ODE9501 [*] Model attribute `_sql_constraints` is no longer supported since Odoo 19.0, define `models.Constraint` attributes on the model instead
  --> deprecated_sql_constraints.py:10:5
   |
 9 |     # ODE9501: the common shape, one entry with a key, a definition and a message.
10 |     _sql_constraints = [
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
11 |         ("name_uniq", "unique (name)", "The name must be unique!"),
12 |     ]
   |
help: Replace with `models.Constraint` attributes
   |
9  |     # ODE9501: the common shape, one entry with a key, a definition and a message.
   -     _sql_constraints = [
   -         ("name_uniq", "unique (name)", "The name must be unique!"),
   -     ]
10 +     _name_uniq = models.Constraint("unique (name)", "The name must be unique!")
11 |
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

